rji@nyquist.cs.nott.ac.uk (Rob Ingram) writes:

>I was playing along happily when I noticed that I had lost 6 points of 
>intrinsic AC gained by paying a priest. I had been messing about taking
>off armour for a couple of reasons and dipped at a fountain (message 
>"you feel a mild(?) chill") but the spoilers say this has no effect.
>I prayed and my god was angry, but no more and I removed all armour to
>check that it actually was intrinsic AC that had been lost.
>So how did I lose the intrinsic AC?

Intrinsic AC gained from your god is a pretty fragile thing. If you do
anything to anger your god, he will remove the protection he granted
you. Since you state that your god was angry with you, you must have
done something to cause this (possibly just praying before prayer
time out if you think you didn't do anything bad, but it could have been
any of a number of things otherwise).

